menu "VAMeter qualification options"

config VAMETER_F15_OBSERVATION
    bool "Enable F15 signed-current observation harness"
    default n
    help
        Qualification-only observation harness for Issue #15 P1/P2 evidence.
        It publishes final PMD measurement metadata into a bounded non-blocking
        queue and drains deterministic diagnostics from a lower-priority task.
        This option does not implement reverse-current detection, relay action,
        a fault state, or any production threshold. Leave disabled for normal
        product builds.

endmenu
